125
00:15:01,244 --> 00:15:02,924
歌うことが正しいかなんて
Whether singing is the right thing

126
00:15:03,684 --> 00:15:05,924
今も答えは見つからないけど
I still can't find the answer,

127
00:15:06,204 --> 00:15:08,074
確かなのは君がいたから
but what I know for sure is you were there,

128
00:15:08,304 --> 00:15:10,624
私はここにいるの
so I am here right now.

129
00:15:10,974 --> 00:15:13,924
何回何十回だって
No matter how many tens of times,

130
00:15:13,924 --> 00:15:16,724
君と出会うから
I'll meet you again.

131
