Um, up until now I've been active mainly focusing on singing, but it was huge to have opportunities for everyone to know and enjoy me from a different aspect than just singing.

215
00:23:50,732 --> 00:24:03,232
え、なんでちょっと改めてね、なんかこう「AZKiってどんな、どんな活動してきたの？」みたいなところからの話になるんですけど
Um, so revisiting that, it leads to talking about 'What kind of activities has AZKi done?' and such.

216
00:24:03,232 --> 00:24:11,232
えーっと、本当に、うんと、これまで決してこう平坦な道ではありませんでした。
Um, truly, um, up until now it has by no means been a smooth path.

217
00:24:11,732 --> 00:24:18,232
え、今まではですね、えっと、ホロライブ所属で活動させてもらっていますが
Um, up until now, um, I've been active belonging to Hololive,

218
00:24:18,732 --> 00:24:25,732
